Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/design-system.md`.

Brand: `modusfi.` wordmark; navy `#101D32`; turquoise `#00B3C6`.
Typography: Manrope semibold (600) headings; Inter regular (400) body.

Keep the established minimalist, enterprise-oriented aesthetic: white/light backgrounds, navy hero/footer, restrained turquoise accents, whitespace, clear hierarchy and modest rounding. Avoid heavy fonts, gratuitous gradients, busy decorative elements, generic fintech stock imagery and gratuitous animation.

Do not redesign the homepage, replace approved imagery, change copy or introduce new colours without a task requiring it. Check desktop and narrow/mobile layouts. Use accessible contrast, keyboard focus and appropriate alt text.
